OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with some late spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine for many. Staying dry
OL,8,Fovernight with clear spells but many
OL,9,Fareas seeing low cloud, mist or fog
OL,10,Fforming later, giving locally poor
OL,11,Fvisibilities. Not as chilly as last
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FEarly fog patches gradually
OL,15,Fclearing to leave some brightness in
OL,16,Feastern counties. Showery rain soon
OL,17,Farriving in west Cornwall, with the
OL,18,Fodd spot developing elsewhere through
OL,19,Fthe afternoon. Cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
