OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry on
OL,6,FSaturday with hazy sunshine at times.
OL,7,FTurning windier on Sunday with rain
OL,8,Fedging eastwards, heavy in places.
OL,9,FFine again on Monday with some
OL,10,Fsunshine. Temperatures remaining above
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
